flowchart TD
  S([Owner wants to sell]) --> I{Owner of vehicle?}
  I -- no --> X1[Reject: NotVehicleOwner]
  I -- yes --> T{Stolen or active loan<br/>or transfer pending?}
  T -- yes --> X2[Reject with reason]
  T -- no --> P[Create pending request]
  P --> D{Buyer decision}
  D -- decline --> C[Request cancelled]
  D -- accept --> Q[Waiting for RTO]
  Q --> R{RTO approves?<br/>re-check stolen / loan}
  R -- blocked --> X3[Reject with reason]
  R -- approve --> O[Owner updated, history appended,<br/>title NFT moved]
  O --> E([Done])
